# Microservice

Purpose
- Provide operational endpoints used during DB key rotations and maintenance (e.g., /migrate)
- Maintain a minimal Prisma schema subset and reencryption logic decoupled from the main app

Key files
- microservice/server.ts — Nitro/H3 bootstrap
- microservice/routes/
  - migrate.get.ts, migrate.post.ts — entrypoints for re-encryption/migrations
  - test.get.ts — simple health/test route
- microservice/clients/ — prismaClient, redisClient
- microservice/prisma/ — schema and generated reencryption code
- microservice/scripts/k8s-rotate-db-key.sh — invoked by CronJob to rotate K8S secret + roll Deployments + call /migrate

Deployment
- Built and pushed by CI to gcr.io as dineros-microservice:<sha>
- Runner variant dineros-microservice:<sha>-keyrotate includes kubectl/jq for CronJob
- Exposed internally via ClusterIP Service; app uses MICROSERVICE_INTERNAL_URL when needed
